<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@/~cl_32__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the words “to rectify the situation and the licensee shall give effect to such direction” the words “to mitigate and rectify the situation and the licensee shall comply with such direction and bear any additional mitigation and rectification cost”. New sections 28a, 28b, 28c and 28d"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> .
