<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@/~cl_40__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “nuclear installation” wherever appearing the word “facilities”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> .
