<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@/~cl_68__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (1), by substituting for the words “The Minister may by order in the Gazette,” the words “The Minister may, upon recommendation of the appropriate authority, by order published in the Gazette,”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> .
