<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting Part II. New Part IIa"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/26/eng@> .
